@host = http://localhost:5236

### Login and obtain a JWT token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Call a protected endpoint (replace {{token}} with the token from the login response)
GET {{host}}/api/secure/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Call an admin-only protected endpoint
GET {{host}}/api/secure/admin-only
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
